 "info": {
  "description": "Bounded simulator subset of the official Amazon SageMaker Service API (2017-07-24). Every other official operation returns HTTP 501 UnknownOperationException. Augmented AI worker task templates and human review workflows (flow definitions) are stored Active configuration: no human loop is started, no task reaches a work team, no output is written to Amazon S3, and the referenced work team, task UI, role and KMS key are not checked. A task template returns only its ContentSha256, not a template Url. Experiments, notebook instance lifecycle configurations and Git code repositories are stored metadata: no trial or run is recorded, no notebook instance runs a lifecycle script (OnCreate and OnStart Content must be base64) and no repository is cloned or its secret read. Names must be lowercase so ARNs keep them unchanged. List filters, sorting and name filters are refused, UpdateCodeRepository is not implemented, AddTags returns no Tags member, and missing resources whose operations model no not-found exception return ResourceNotFoundException with HTTP 400. Training, processing, transform, tuning, labeling, inference and every other job, models, endpoints and endpoint configurations, notebook instances, Studio domains and apps, pipelines, feature groups, model registry, work teams and workforces return UnknownOperationException with HTTP 501.",
  "title": "Amazon SageMaker (simulator catalog)",
  "version": "2017-07-24"
 },
